WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.064 --> 00:00:07.231
- When I was 20, I stopped
talking for like three months.

00:00:08.419 --> 00:00:09.507
I didn't know what was wrong.

00:00:09.507 --> 00:00:10.507
It was dark.

00:00:12.920 --> 00:00:15.178
The only time I used
my voice was at night.

00:00:15.178 --> 00:00:17.613
I would walk by myself and I would sing.

00:00:17.613 --> 00:00:19.491
I never sang before then.

00:00:19.491 --> 00:00:23.158
I needed to listen to
the voice inside of me

00:00:24.972 --> 00:00:27.639
to find out what my purpose was.

00:00:28.493 --> 00:00:32.483
I decided, I remember I was
like, "I'm gonna be a singer."

00:00:32.483 --> 00:00:35.066
(upbeat music)

00:00:37.155 --> 00:00:41.656
I'm Lizzo; I am a rapper; I'm
a singer; I'm a songwriter;

00:00:41.656 --> 00:00:45.176
and I live in Los Angeles, California..

00:00:45.176 --> 00:00:46.561
Once I decided to become a singer,

00:00:46.561 --> 00:00:49.101
my mission became very clear to me.

00:00:49.101 --> 00:00:51.533
My music is activism
because my mere existence

00:00:51.533 --> 00:00:55.437
as a musician is activism,
and I want you to use the song

00:00:55.437 --> 00:00:59.520
to activate you to make
the world a better place.

00:01:01.815 --> 00:01:05.656
You don't see black women, you
don't see big girls like me,

00:01:05.656 --> 00:01:08.064
and that should change.

00:01:08.064 --> 00:01:11.117
I wanna see tons of plus size pop stars.

00:01:11.117 --> 00:01:12.931
I wanna see black girl magic.

00:01:12.931 --> 00:01:15.348
I just wanna see us way more.

00:01:16.344 --> 00:01:19.864
Imagine a heaven where all
of the angels and goddesses

00:01:19.864 --> 00:01:23.697
are thick and voluptuous
and just scrumptious.

00:01:29.528 --> 00:01:30.825
Growing up in Detroit, I was raised

00:01:30.825 --> 00:01:34.008
very, very, very strict Pentecostal.

00:01:34.008 --> 00:01:37.357
Couldn't go to the movies,
couldn't listen to secular music.

00:01:37.357 --> 00:01:38.774
It was the devil.

00:01:40.088 --> 00:01:42.179
♫ Can't stop till I believe

00:01:42.179 --> 00:01:46.806
♫ That I'm perfect in my own mind

00:01:46.806 --> 00:01:47.808
When you're finding your voice,

00:01:47.808 --> 00:01:49.368
you can't have any
restrictions on yourself

00:01:49.368 --> 00:01:51.053
and you can't have any fears,

00:01:51.053 --> 00:01:55.167
so I had to let go of all
of that to find my voice,

00:01:55.167 --> 00:02:00.013
and she a little ratchet, but
my family still loves her.

00:02:00.013 --> 00:02:01.357
- Give me one more and I'll let you go.

00:02:01.357 --> 00:02:04.107
- Okay, I’ma turn myself up.

00:02:07.587 --> 00:02:08.931
I wouldn't be here if I didn't

00:02:08.931 --> 00:02:10.531
stop talking for three months.

00:02:10.531 --> 00:02:12.685
I wouldn't be here if I didn't
tell myself to be a singer.

00:02:12.685 --> 00:02:16.852
Everything else actually just
started falling into place.

00:02:17.784 --> 00:02:20.813
That's what finding your
purpose is all about.

00:02:20.813 --> 00:02:22.968
The universe conspires with you.

00:02:22.968 --> 00:02:25.551
(upbeat music)

